{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use the cue stick to pot all the balls to clear the level. However, be careful\u2014if the cue ball falls into a pocket three times in a row, the game will end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Controls:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Shooting:</strong> Hold the left mouse button and use the &quot;Q&quot; and &quot;E&quot; keys to adjust the cue stick's direction. Release the left mouse button to strike the ball with the selected power.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Camera View:</strong> Right-click to switch the camera view.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game offers two modes: <strong>Normal Mode</strong> and <strong>Crazy Mode</strong>.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Normal Mode:</strong> The ball's movement follows real-world physics, such as bouncing off walls as expected.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Crazy Mode:</strong> The ball's movement is unpredictable and may not behave as expected, creating unexpected challenges.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3595960?t=1742362655","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3595960?t=1742362655","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595960/04e48e236062dca23cff035fd1d3581f1e374deb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742362655","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595960/04e48e236062dca23cff035fd1d3581f1e374deb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742362655","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use the cue stick to pot all the balls to clear the level. However, be careful\u2014i